silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_03_probe_domesticcat_collapse_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeDomesticCatCollapseLegLambdaCls', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, JoC §11.1: the diagram D_Mittens places DomesticCat at a distinct index position from TaxRow; lambda_cls is the outgoing classification leg." .
